#only("3-")[- Active strategies may exploit inefficiencies 📈]
// The behavioral finance critique of EMH is shown as bullet points from slide 1 onward
#only("1")[
#voiceover("However, behavioral finance challenges the assumptions of EMH by arguing that psychological biases can lead to market inefficiencies.")
]
#only("2")[
#voiceover("Irrational investor behavior can cause assets to be mispriced, deviating from their fundamental values.")
]
#only("3")[
#voiceover("Behavioral finance suggests that active investment strategies may be able to exploit these inefficiencies and generate higher returns.")
]
]

